    {
      "author": "Hunter",
      "date": "2026-07-11",
      "rating": 5,
      "source": "Google",
      "text": "Ms. Freda has completely transformed the experience at Ibex Uptown. When I first arrived, the overall management experience was disappointing, and it often felt like tenant concerns weren’t being addressed effectively. Since her recent arrival as Assistant Principal Manager, I’ve witnessed a remarkable improvement in the quality of administration.\n\nShe is thorough, patient, professional, and genuinely committed to raising the standard of excellence throughout the property. What stands out most is her willingness to go above and beyond to ensure tenants feel heard, respected, and valued. She approaches every situation with integrity and follows through on her commitments, which has made a noticeable difference in the community.\n\nIt’s refreshing to see someone who takes pride in their work and leads by example. Ms. Frida is exactly the kind of leader Ibex Uptown needs, and her dedication is already making a positive impact. I sincerely appreciate her hard work and look forward to seeing the continued improvements under her leadership.",
      "responded": true,
      "response": "We appreciate your kind recognition of Ms. Freda's dedication and commitment to improving the Ibex Uptown community experience. It is indeed refreshing to have someone like her who takes pride in their work and leads by example. We're thrilled that you feel heard, respected, and valued under her leadership and we assure you that we will strive to continue improving the quality of our administration. Thank you for acknowledging Ms. Freda's efforts and being part of our community.",
      "responseDate": "2026-07-14"
    },
    {
