      "author": "Grant Tyrolt",
      "date": "2026-06-05",
      "rating": 1,
      "source": "Google",
      "text": "Ibex has an excellent location and easy access to the MARTA rail. I at one point considered living here while looking for an apartment with great MARAT access and was excited to hear a friend moved in so I could see the place.\n\nIbex easily has the slowest elevators in existence. They have two but one has been out of service for months now. You can easily wait 10-12 minutes for the elevator to the point where it’s easier to just that the stairs. The stairwells are filthy and have rotting food debris littered across the stairwell. At this there has been broken glass left around the stairs.\n\nThe floors are honestly mopped semi-annually it seems around here. so any common area flooring is disgusting and reek. The hallways smell like you are in a spice market mix with garbage.\n\nAfter seeing the abhorrent conditions this apartment leaves common area for the months at a time I would strongly suggest weighing the pros with the cons. In my honest opinion unless things improve with the overall cleanness over the facilities I would definitely recommend anyone to tour and see it for yourself.",
      "responded": true,
      "response": "Thank you for your feedback, Grant. We appreciate your detailed observations, and we understand your concerns about the cleanliness and maintenance of the common areas. We believe in creating a pleasant community environment and are always open to suggestions for improvement. Please contact me at 404-842-1301 or eonmanager@castlegateprop.com. We're dedicated to enhancing our community based on your feedback.",
      "responseDate": "2026-06-05"
    },
