      "date": "2026-05-19",
      "rating": 1,
      "source": "Google",
      "text": "have lived over here for over 3 years and all I can say is the apartment management keeps deteriorating!!! The elevator for building one( the same building the leasing office is) has not been working for months and it has not yet been fixed so the only fast alternative is to use the stairs but one of the gates has also been bad without been fixed for months which the homeless people comes in through and has access to the stair to make this mess. This is health hazard and it saddens my heart that they changed management but all the next management cares about is to send mails about party in the lounge.\n\nPlease fix this we pay monthly and yet nothing good is been given back in return‼️\n\nI cannot wait for my lease to be over, I’m out of here",
      "responded": true,
