    {
      "author": "Tonja Benford",
      "date": "2026-04-19",
      "rating": 5,
      "source": "Google",
      "text": "I have had 95% of positive vibes since I’ve been in my new place. As far as the roach situation goes. It’s mainly because of the valet trash being in the hallways along with the dumpsters being in the garage. However cleanliness is an individual thing. I absolutely love the staff Mrs. Pam along with the other ladies in the office is amazing. The residents are friendly.  I would give this place an 8 out of 10.\n\n3/8/2026\nGood afternoon\nFirst and far most. I have never seen a team/staff of people that work so hard to resolve any/all issues that have had if any. Mrs Katt, Mrs. Pam, Miss Shay, Mr. Jay are very kind, professional and eager to please. You don’t find those qualities in a staff anymore. The maintenance staff is phenomenal. I haven’t seen any roaches/insects lately. The crew does a great job with keeping building one and two clean. So you see every complex has its own issues and problems. However it’s the way you do things ( handle business) so you see I appreciate the staff. Its a pleasure to reside here.",
      "responded": true,
      "response": "Thanks for your kind words, Tonja. We're delighted to hear about your positive experiences with our dedicated team and the maintenance crew. We appreciate your feedback and hope to continue providing a great living environment for you.\nBest, Erika Kelly, Property Manager",
      "responseDate": "2026-04-19"
    },
