    {
      "author": "Seth Moore",
      "date": "2026-03-19",
      "rating": 1,
      "source": "Google",
      "text": "If it were possible to put 0 stars I would.\n\nThis company (that will knock your damn door down to get rent 3 days after due) will do absolutely NO work for you in answering maintenance requests, responding to answers in a timely manner, or just plainly being honest.\n\nI asked straight up one time what they were doing about the roach problem. They looked panicked. With any lapse in extermination services, and the temps warming back up again soon, it’s only going to get worse again. This building will need to be condemned.\n\nNever live here. Under any circumstances.\n\nAnd to management, who will definitely read this and copy and paste their canned response about being “sorry” and that I should reach out… I have. Many times. So shove it. Your actions will speak for you from here.\n\nWhat I’m noticing is a problematic trend across metro Atlanta, where corporate leasing services build an apartment as cheap as possible, rent em out at market rate, quickly make their ROI, then stifle the quality of the apartment after a number of years with a reduced maintenance budget and general overall neglect.\n\nDo not fall victim to this. Read reviews. Ask friends. Contact residents.",
      "responded": true,
      "response": "We appreciate your feedback, Seth. Hearing about your experience is important to us. We understand your concerns about maintenance and pest control, as these are crucial aspects of a comfortable living experience. We're committed to enhancing our community and addressing these issues promptly. For a more personalized discussion, please contact me at 404-842-1301 or eonmanager@castlegateprop.com",
      "responseDate": "2026-03-19"
    },
    {
      "author": "Travies Mims",
      "date": "2026-03-19",
      "rating": 5,
      "source": "Google",
      "text": "We are so grateful for your positive review, Travies!\n\n We hope to always provide a great experience at Ibex Uptown. Don’t hesitate to reach out if there’s a way we can improve serving you. Thanks again!  \n\nIbex Uptown / IbexUptown@assetliving.com",
      "responded": true,
      "response": "We are so grateful for your positive review, Travies!\n\n We hope to always provide a great experience at Ibex Uptown. Don’t hesitate to reach out if there’s a way we can improve serving you. Thanks again!  \n\nIbex Uptown / IbexUptown@assetliving.com",
      "responseDate": "2026-03-19"
