    {
      "author": "Chase Christmas",
      "date": "2026-03-19",
      "rating": 1,
      "source": "Google",
      "text": "Worst experience with the leasing office. J hung up in my face when I asked why didn’t they send a letter of our approval or denial. Shay is young, does not respond to emails, and does not give calls back. They are incredibly untrustworthy and don’t deserve to be leasing agents. I hope they get new staff soon. Worst experience ever. No customer service and rushy as if they are replying and answering calls.",
      "responded": true,
