      "rating": 1,
      "source": "Google",
      "text": "I put in a maintenance request to have the dishwasher fixed once verbally and twice via the website. The dishwasher is still not functioning properly. All the staff that saw it did the same thing by draining it, but no one has repaired it. I was told it would be replaced, but it has not. The work order says complete online, but that is not correct. There is no receipt or notice left behind showing or verification of what work was actually done. It’s disappointing.",
      "responded": true,
