      "author": "Porsche Jenkins",
      "date": "2025-09-19",
      "rating": 2,
      "source": "Google",
      "text": "I’m a current resident since 2024… this building has a bunch of unresolved issues… real bad bug infestation they they seem to not care about after numerous request were put in for pest control. The elevator is missing buttons and i have to go up or down a floor just to get to my apartment back on the 3rd floor. I’ve put in multiple request to have my dishwasher fixed and it’s been over 2months. Very unhappy cause I haven’t been able to use the amenities that I pay for … the gym has broken machines that don’t work. I don’t recommend AT ALL!!!!!!",
      "responded": true,
      "response": "Thank you for your feedback, Porsche. We deeply regret to hear about your experience with pest control and amenity maintenance. Your satisfaction is a priority for us and we're eager to address these concerns. For a more personalized discussion, we're here to listen. Please contact me at 404-842-1301 or eonmanager@castlegateprop.com",
      "responseDate": "2025-09-19"
    },
